{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"4df1040471bdf351","type":"group","x":-580,"y":70,"width":1140,"height":840,"label":"source"},
		{"id":"14f03ed9cf1d85d8","type":"group","x":-580,"y":-910,"width":1160,"height":680,"label":"Client"},
		{"id":"14601d1628436e8f","type":"text","text":"### Embedding input (Before)\n\nVena Solutions is a cloud-native FP&A platform that integrates seamlessly with Microsoft 365, enabling collaborative budgeting, forecasting, and reporting for over 2,000 clients across various industries. The platform utilizes a multi-dimensional model encompassing Accounts, Departments, Entities, Periods, and Scenarios, ensuring dimensional integrity and scenario validation. Its data ecosystem includes a General Ledger (GL) source, which provides critical financial data through account_master, departments_data, and journal_entries tables, supporting comprehensive financial reporting. Vena maintains a robust validation framework with 20+ quality checks focused on completeness and consistency, enhancing operational accuracy and decision-making.","x":-560,"y":-630,"width":560,"height":360},
		{"id":"c4f35a6fa0932b0d","type":"text","text":"### Embedding input (After)\nVena Solutions operates a cloud-native FP&A platform that integrates with Microsoft 365, facilitating collaborative budgeting, forecasting, and reporting for over 2,000 clients. The platform utilizes a multi-dimensional model encompassing Accounts, Departments, Entities, Periods, and Scenarios, ensuring dimensional integrity and scenario validation. The data ecosystem includes 1 source, the General Ledger (GL), which supports accurate financial reporting and analysis through 55 validation rules focused on referential integrity, completeness, and consistency. This comprehensive validation framework enhances data quality across source-level, table-level, and column-level checks, ensuring reliable financial insights and decision-making.","x":40,"y":-630,"width":500,"height":360},
		{"id":"162f7236e3a1c2d5","type":"text","text":"### Description (Before)\nThe General Ledger (GL) source provides essential financial data through its account_master, departments_data, and journal_entries tables, supporting comprehensive financial reporting and analysis.","x":-560,"y":90,"width":560,"height":200},
		{"id":"6e91dac4c491f52e","type":"text","text":"### Description (After)\n\nThe General Ledger (GL) source provides essential financial data through its tables, including account details, departmental information, and journal entries, supporting accurate financial reporting and analysis.","x":80,"y":90,"width":460,"height":200},
		{"id":"53638ac631d5b57f","type":"text","text":"### Embedding input (Before)\n\nThe General Ledger (GL) serves as a critical source within Vena Solutions' FP&A platform, facilitating the management of financial data across multiple dimensions such as Accounts, Departments, and Scenarios. It encompasses three key tables: account_master, which details financial accounts including identifiers and classifications; departments_data, which provides insights into departmental structures and budget allocations; and journal_entries, which records all financial transactions through detailed journal entries. This source supports operational decision-making and analytical workflows by ensuring dimensional integrity and scenario validation, thereby enhancing the accuracy of Actuals, Budgets, and Forecasts. The GL implements 20+ validation rules focusing on referential integrity and business logic, maintaining comprehensive validation coverage across table and column levels to ensure data quality and governance maturity.","x":-560,"y":370,"width":560,"height":520},
		{"id":"b5a71bb8e281b1c5","type":"text","text":"### Embedding input (After)\nThe General Ledger (GL) source serves as a critical component of the financial planning and analysis ecosystem, integrating data from three key tables: account_master, departments_data, and journal_entries. The account_master table maintains comprehensive details about financial accounts, including identifiers, classifications, and statuses, ensuring dimensional integrity and facilitating accurate reporting. The departments_data table captures detailed information about organizational departments, encompassing identifiers, management details, and budget allocations, which are vital for departmental financial oversight. The journal_entries table records detailed transactions, providing a historical account of financial activities. This source implements 55+ validation rules across various scopes, including source-level checks for referential integrity and table-level validations for data consistency, ensuring high data quality and governance maturity. Key validation focus areas include account referencing, department integrity, and transaction accuracy, supporting robust decision-making workflows and analytical requirements within the organization.","x":80,"y":370,"width":460,"height":520},
		{"id":"4bd7d0db333c3b19","type":"text","text":"### Description (Before)\nVena Solutions operates in the Financial Technology sector, providing an AI-powered financial planning and analysis platform that enhances budgeting, forecasting, and reporting for businesses, particularly those utilizing Microsoft Excel.","x":-560,"y":-890,"width":540,"height":220},
		{"id":"6b6c98f5623cd35f","type":"text","text":"### Description (After)\n\nVena Solutions is a leading AI-powered financial planning and analysis (FP&A) platform in the FinTech industry, focusing on enhancing budgeting, forecasting, and reporting processes through seamless integrations with Microsoft 365.","x":40,"y":-890,"width":480,"height":220},
		{"id":"4ec57594b6d0264c","x":-440,"y":-3760,"width":640,"height":400,"type":"text","text":"Vena Solutions is a cloud-native FP&A platform designed to streamline financial planning, budgeting, and reporting, leveraging integrations with Microsoft 365 applications. The platform supports over 50 data sources, including sp_stru_test for client transaction data, School_Information_System for educational data management, and FINANCIAL_DATA_V6 for comprehensive financial analysis. Other key sources include Balance_Sheet_Validation for reconciling accounts, and various Microsoft SharePoint sources for balanced transaction data. These sources collectively ensure accurate financial insights and operational efficiency. Vena adheres to more than 20 validation rules, focusing on cross-source-level checks for customer references and ensuring data integrity through null checks and valid email formats. The integration of AI through Vena Copilot enhances predictive insights, making it a vital tool for finance teams across diverse industries such as SaaS, Healthcare, and Professional Services."},
		{"id":"e398ce23306e5041","x":-495,"y":-3076,"width":795,"height":276,"type":"text","text":"The POSTGRES_TEST_15 source is integral to Vena Solutions' FP&A platform, focusing on customer data management. The primary table, 'customers', contains vital customer profiles, demographics, and transaction history, which are essential for budgeting, forecasting, and reporting. Key attributes include customer_id, email, and address, with relationships established through foreign keys to orders and e-commerce records. This source supports business processes such as customer validation and transaction tracking. Technical characteristics include constraints on null values for customer_id and address, as well as format checks for email addresses. The source is governed by more than 10 validation rules, including checks for valid customer references and ensuring created_at timestamps precede updated_at timestamps, enhancing data quality and reliability."}
	],
	"edges":[]
}